});
```

Wait: `MarkdownEditorSplitMode` values — check preset-base-types: probably 'horizontal' | 'vertical' | false. The guide used `splitMode: 'horizontal'` at top level (old API?) — in current API it's under `markupConfig.splitMode`. The guide example passed them at top level of useMarkdownEditor props (`initialEditorMode`, `initialSplitModeEnabled`, `splitMode`) — but installed v15 types show `initial.mode`, `initial.splitModeEnabled`, `markupConfig.splitMode`. Trust installed types (skill says: trust typechecker over docs).

