Hmm. Both defensible. I'll default to `wysiwyg`? No — let me think again about what "сразу видит форматирование" means. In wysiwyg, you type `**bold**` and it becomes bold right in place — that's "пишешь markdown и сразу видишь форматирование" literally too. And wysiwyg is the editor's default and primary mode.

I'll go with wysiwyg as initial mode (immediate inline formatting) AND enable split preview for markup mode, so in markup mode you also see live rendering. This is the most complete interpretation. The field's toolbar provides both.

